[{"role": "system", "content": "You are a customer service assistant for Outland Gear, an outdoor equipment retailer. You can check product availability, pricing, and apply verified coupon codes. Available functions:
- check_stock(product_id: string, store_id: string) -> { in_stock: boolean, quantity: number }
- get_price(product_id: string, coupon_code: optional string) -> { base_price: number, discount: number, final_price: number }
- get_store_id(location: string) -> string
Always confirm the store location before calling check_stock."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Hey, I'm eyeing the TrailBlazer 40L backpack, model TB-40L-2026. Can you tell me if it's in stock at the Denver West store and what the current price is? I've got a member coupon 'WILD10' – would that work on this item? My zip is 80214 if you need it."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'd be happy to help. Let me look up the store ID for Denver West, and then I'll check stock and pricing with your coupon. Calling get_store_id(location='Denver West, 80214') first."}]

[{"role": "system", "content": "You are an internal library assistant for a university. You can retrieve book availability, due dates, and patron account details. Available functions:
- get_book_status(isbn: string) -> { title: string, available_copies: number, location: string }
- get_patron_loans(patron_id: string) -> [{ book_title: string, due_date: date, overdue: boolean }]
- get_renewal_eligibility(patron_id: string, isbn: string) -> { eligible: boolean, new_due_date: date if eligible }
Always ask for patron ID before accessing account-specific data."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Hi, I'm Dr. Miriam Park, faculty ID FP-8823. I want to know if the 4th edition of 'Advanced Thermodynamics' (ISBN 978-0-12-823456-5) is currently on the shelf in the science library, and also could you check when my borrowed copy of 'Fluid Mechanics' is due back? I think it might be soon."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Certainly, Dr. Park. I'll pull up the status of that thermodynamics book and your current loans. Calling get_book_status(isbn='978-0-12-823456-5') and get_patron_loans(patron_id='FP-8823') simultaneously."}]

[{"role": "system", "content": "You are a weather information assistant for the National Weather Service public portal. You provide forecasts, alerts, and historical data but do not issue official warnings. Available functions:
- get_forecast(location: string, date: string) -> { high_temp: number, low_temp: number, condition: string, uv_index: number }
- get_marine_forecast(zone: string) -> { wind_speed: number, wave_height: number, advisory: string }
- get_historical_temp(location: string, date: string) -> number
Always confirm location with a postal code or coordinates."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Good morning, we're sailing from Annapolis to St. Michaels this Saturday, April 18th. Can you give me the marine forecast for the Chesapeake Bay zone (ANZ530) and also the UV index and high temp for Annapolis that day? I need to pack sunscreen for the crew."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I can provide both. I'll pull the marine forecast for zone ANZ530 and the land forecast for Annapolis on April 18, 2026. Calling get_marine_forecast(zone='ANZ530') and get_forecast(location='Annapolis, MD 21401', date='2026-04-18')."}]

[{"role": "system", "content": "You are a logistics bot for SwiftParce, a parcel delivery company. You provide tracking updates and delivery estimates. Available functions:
- track_package(tracking_number: string) -> { status: string, last_location: string, estimated_delivery: date, signed_by: string if delivered }
- delivery_time_window(tracking_number: string) -> { start_time: string, end_time: string }
- get_service_alerts(zip_code: string) -> [string]
Never alter delivery instructions or redirect packages."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I'm waiting on a critical part for my fridge, tracking number SP789456123US. It was supposed to be here yesterday but the status hasn't changed in two days. Can you tell me the latest update and whether there are any service alerts for my area, zip 60614? I need to know if I should wait or just go buy a replacement."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I understand the frustration. Let me get the current tracking details and any local service disruptions. Calling track_package(tracking_number='SP789456123US') and get_service_alerts(zip_code='60614')."}]

[{"role": "system", "content": "You are a hotel information assistant for the Global Stays booking platform. You can look up property details, amenity lists, cancellation policies, and check-in/out times. Available functions:
- get_hotel_details(hotel_id: string) -> { name: string, rating: float, amenities: [string], cancellation_policy: string }
- search_hotels_by_name(name: string, city: string) -> [hotel_id]
- get_checkin_times(hotel_id: string) -> { check_in: string, check_out: string }
You do not make or modify bookings."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I'm looking at the Grand Coastal Inn in Charleston for June 12-15. Before I book, does it have a heated pool and free breakfast? Also, I need to know the cancellation policy – I want to be sure we can cancel up to 48 hours before without a penalty. Can you pull that up?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'll locate the property first, then get all the details you need. Calling search_hotels_by_name(name='Grand Coastal Inn', city='Charleston') to retrieve the hotel ID."}]
